                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo d'uftu, kooti kiyya ka anini Troa keesa mana Karpoti lakise na kootiini; kitaaba ch'ufaani kooti, keesuma tatabe gogaa.",
          "type": "text",
